## Model head & embeddings — qbits: 16 
^token_embd\.weight$=sgl_bf16
^output\.weight$=sgl_bf16

## Multi-headed attention parameters — qbits: 4 
^blk\.([0-9]|[1-8][0-9]|9[0-2])\.attn_output\.weight$=sgl_nvfp4
